# Visual fidelity

## Color match (logo / baked PNG)

- Logo with solid bg that must blend: sample dominant corner pixels → CSS var
- Prefer **transparent logo** over fighting a baked rectangle
- Brand-critical marks: `unoptimized` on `next/image` when exact match matters

## Layered backgrounds

```
relative isolate section
  ::before or div → solid / gradient (brand color)
  ::after or div → image / pattern (transparent asset, low opacity)
  content → relative z-10
```

- Reject broken assets (near-flat grey plates)
- Do not use `mix-blend-mode: screen` on opaque grey plates

## Card hover borders

- Border wraps **image + text** (full card), slightly outside radius when designed
- Measure with `ResizeObserver`; SVG viewBox = pixel size
- Parents (Swiper slide, motion.li): `overflow-visible` when border draws outside

## Seams & chrome

- One intentional top accent max
- Dividers: single subtle border (e.g. `border-white/20`) unless design specifies more
